sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant T as Scheduler
    participant I as Ingestion
    participant EX as feed.events
    participant C as Cleansing
    participant P as Prediction Context Aggregator
    participant KG as Neo4j
    participant MD as Market Data
    participant LLM as LLM Gateway

    T->>I: Fire bounded polling job
    I->>I: Poll approved RSS sources and optional circuit-broken GDELT
    I->>EX: article.ingested
    EX->>C: cleansing.articles
    C->>C: SimHash, BGE-m3, taxonomy Gate 2
    alt Deterministic extraction is valid
        C->>C: Build canonical EventDetected locally (polarity, context_tags)
    else Ambiguous merge or fact conflict
        C->>LLM: Compact untrusted article excerpts
        LLM-->>C: Schema-constrained event fields
    end
    C->>EX: event.detected
    EX->>P: prediction.events
    P->>P: Add event to asset context window (store polarity, context_tags)
    Note over P: Context closes at watermark or creates a newer version for late events
    P->>MD: GET /prices/recent (is asset elevated?)
    MD-->>P: Recent session closes
    P->>KG: Fetch edges for event type gated by active conditions
    KG-->>P: Signed weighted forces by canonical asset
    Note over P: RESOLUTION inverts edge sign; resolution-driven DOWN suppressed unless RISK_PREMIUM_ELEVATED
    alt All retained forces agree
        P->>P: Deterministic GRAPH_ONLY prediction
    else Forces conflict in M1
        P->>P: Graph-only policy records conflicting force evidence
    else Future approved arbitration experiment
        P->>LLM: One compact call for asset and context version
        LLM-->>P: Direction, confidence, magnitude, short rationale
    end
    P->>P: Store immutable prediction and optional LLM metadata
    P->>EX: prediction.made
